# Service-account keys. These bypass every Firestore security rule and grant
# full read/write to the database — a committed one is a total compromise,
# not a leak of configuration. The server reads the key from an environment
# variable instead; see docs/RENDER.md.
*serviceAccount*.json
*service-account*.json
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
